{"ticker":{"symbol":"900140.KS","name":"엘브이엠씨홀딩스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1038.0,"change_pct":0.0028985507246377384,"market_cap":200265678848.0,"pe":6.105882,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":976.0,"week52_high":1854.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"Cayman Islands","city":"Grand Cayman","employees":null,"website":"https://www.lvmcholdings.net","business_summary":"LVMC Holdings manufactures, imports, and distributes automobiles and motorcycles in Vietnam and internationally. The company sells commercial trucks, and heavy equipment, as well as provides after-sales and installment finance services. It also sells parts and accessories of automobiles and motorcycles; and provides maintenance services for automobiles and motorcycles. In addition, the company engages in used car trading business. It offers its products through DAEHAN, TERACO, and KR Motors brands. The company was formerly known as KOLAO Holdings Co., and changed its name to LVMC Holdings in March 2018. LVMC Holdings was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Grand Cayman, the Cayman Islands.","business_summary_ko":"LVMC Holdings는 베트남 및 해외에서 자동차와 오토바이를 제조, 수입 및 유통합니다. 이 회사는 상업용 트럭, 중장비 판매는 물론 사후 및 할부 금융 서비스도 제공합니다. 또한 자동차와 오토바이의 부품과 액세서리도 판매합니다. 자동차와 오토바이에 대한 유지보수 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 중고차 매매업도 영위하고 있습니다. 대한, 테라코, 케이알모터스 브랜드를 통해 제품을 제공하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 코라오홀딩스(KOLAO Holdings Co.)로 알려졌으며, 2018년 3월 LVMC 홀딩스로 사명을 변경했습니다. LVMC 홀딩스는 1997년 설립되었으며 케이먼 제도 그랜드케이먼에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":4858000000000.0,"rev_lo":4858000000000.0,"rev_hi":4858000000000.0,"rev_g":null,"n":1,"eps":132.0,"eps_lo":132.0,"eps_hi":132.0,"eps_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":5737000000000.0,"rev_lo":5737000000000.0,"rev_hi":5737000000000.0,"rev_g":0.18090001,"n":1,"eps":170.0,"eps_lo":170.0,"eps_hi":170.0,"eps_g":0.2879}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"자동차","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":249278550000.0,"ope